 "#353", "size": [270, 290.00006103515625], "pos": [1659.256103515625, 0], "id": 10, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 11, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [570.5061645507812, 912.885986328125], "pos": [988.75, 0], "id": 12, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["## 图像描述与分析\n\n**主体：** 一条深蓝色男士平角内裤（产品展示）。\n\n**产品信息：**\n* **产品名称/品牌：** AURUM\n* **产品形态：** 男士平角内裤\n* **产品形状：** 标准平角内裤轮廓\n* **产品材质/特点：** 亲肤柔软、透气干燥、无痕不勒、高弹不紧绷、无痕腰边不勒印。\n* **颜色：** 深海军蓝/藏青色。\n\n**视觉布局与元素：**\n1. **顶部区域：** 醒目宣传语“柔软贴身 舒适每一刻”。\n2. **左侧区域：** 产品特性图标展示（亲肤柔软、透气干燥、无痕不勒）以及一个米色针织物（可能是搭配或环境元素）。\n3. **中部/右侧区域：** 产品特写展示，包括内裤平铺和局部拉伸展示，强调材质的柔软度和弹性。\n4. **底部区域：** “24小时贴身伴侣”的使用场景图标展示（办公久坐、运动健身、出差旅行、睡眠休息）。\n\n**整体风格：** 现代、简洁、专业的产品广告风格，强调功能性和舒适性。\n\n---\n\n## 关键词提取 (Keywords)\n\n**核心产品词：** 男士平角内裤, AURUM, 内裤, 贴身衣物。\n**功能/卖点词：** 柔软, 舒适, 透气, 无痕, 高弹, 亲肤, 贴身伴侣。\n**场景词：** 办公, 运动, 旅行, 睡眠。\n**视觉词：** 深蓝色, 特写, 广告, 简约。\n\n---\n\n## 结构化输出 (Structured Output)\n\n**(此部分模仿AI生成广告素材的指令)**\n\n**Prompt for Image Generation (If needed):**\n\"A high-quality, modern product advertisement for deep navy men's brief underwear by the brand AURUM. The layout must be clean and professional. Feature close-up shots demonstrating the fabric's extreme softness and elasticity. Include icons highlighting key features: skin-friendly, breathable, and seamless. The overall mood should convey ultimate comfort for 24-hour wear.\"\n\n**Detailed Description for Review:**\n\"The advertisement showcases the AURUM men's briefs in a rich navy color. Key selling points are visually reinforced through text and functional icons: 'Soft & Seamless for Every Moment.' Product sections include a flat lay and a stretched view emphasizing the non-constricting, high-elasticity material. The bottom section uses small, relevant icons to map out usage scenarios: sitting at work, exercising, traveling, and sleeping.\"\n\n**Target Audience:**\nMen aged 20-45 who prioritize comfort, quality, and functional design in their daily wear.\n\n**Emotional Appeal:**\nConfidence, Security, and Ultimate Comfort."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 10, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [420.469970703125, 565.314453125], "pos": [600, 1032.885986328125], "id": 11, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [4244.16357421875, 188.47705078125], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-1157.4537353515625, -532.1699829101562], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 14, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "粉丝福利：点击\"右上角自己的头像\">邀请码>填写邀请码：【tkrajhbk】送1000RH币", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#ff2929"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [3066.3857421875, 210.6992645263672], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-515.3072509765625, -260.69927978515625], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 15, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "每天登录还有100币  邀请码：【tkrajh